{"resourceIdentifier":"2593","resourceName":"Botou Hengjie MSW landfill site LFG comprehensive utilization project","description":"Botou Hengjie MSW landfill site LFG comprehensive utilization project (hereafter referred to as the project) is located at Qiyan village MSW landfill site (hereafter referred to as the Hengjie landfill site), in Botou City, Hebei Province, P.R. China. The project is constructed and operated by Botou City BCCY New Energy CO., Ltd. (hereafter referred to as the project owner).\r\nThe project started to construct on 22/06/2020.The project has a total designed capacity 1.2MW (2*0.6MW) and combusts the LFG, which contains nearly 50% of methane, to generate electricity and export it to the North China Power Grid (NCPG). Total electricity supplied to the grid in the crediting period will be 56,704MWh. VCUs will be claimed from the methane destroyed and the grid electricity displaced. The estimated average GHG emission reductions of the project is 35,034tCO2e and the total GHG emission reductions and removals are 350,342tCO2e during the fixed 10 years crediting period.","location":{"latitude":38.137500,"longitude":116.587220},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2021-10-15","endExclusive":"2021-11-15","endInclusive":"2021-11-14"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2593"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hebei Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan BCCY Environmental Energy CO.,LTD."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan, China"},{"type":"string","value":"86 371 6552 1782"},{"type":"string","value":"lwang@bccynewpower.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2593"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"35034"}]},{"code":"P